WEBVTT

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.910
Get the Goat Sports Daily!

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.040
It's a victory sale-tori!

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.000
How about a Tricolore flower-tori...!?

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.360
The headline says "Semifinals today, Tricolore Divine Idol Checkmate!"

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.650
Hibiki-sama wouldn't lose!

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.560
Falulu-sama, Fuwari-chan!

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:24.000
Okay, okay. Don't push-dechu.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.390
Falulu's color is white!

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.600
Pure white like snow-dechu!

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.920
I've got a hundred, so don't push and line up-dechu!

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.540
I said don't push...

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.030
The probability that Solami Smile will beat Tricolore are...

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:23.700
Zero.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.260
What percent was it?

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:28.750
Uhh... Never mind-pri...

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.590
I was calculating how many sleeps until new year-pri!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.530
Leave this to me-kuma!

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:38.750
You can't even dare utter the word "lose" here-kuma!

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.040
Not even by accident-kuma!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:44.120
Everyone, let's cheer up and toast with some vegetable juice-kuma!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.850
They <i>gave</i> me 50% off!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.170
<i>Gave... Gave... Gave... Gave...</i>

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:53.230
Screw vegetable juice, how about some delicious <i>make</i> roni!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.220
You mean <i>maca</i>roni-pri.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.950
Ah, I'm so furry.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:02:59.940
What do you mean?

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.620
Ah it's no good!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.460
Support call!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.790
It's always nerve-racking before a performance.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.390
How's it going?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:16.920
W-We're doing very well obviously-pri

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:19.970
We'll see you in the final-pri!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:20.400
Pshuu.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.630
Haha nice try.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:26.730
I'll pray that Maho-chan falls and sprains his ankle for you.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.380
Regardless of who wins, we'll surpass our limits!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.080
The only way for us is up!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.830
Surpassing our limits?

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:47.970
One!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.980
Two!

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:51.970
One!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.890
What a miraculous feeling.

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:59.180
I'm so nervous, yet so excited.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.650
Falulu too!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:07.020
Dancing with friends and competing with friends.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.570
I'm so happy!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.160
For a country girl running around the Palps fields,

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.180
to be in this position...

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.040
It's a miracle!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.450
PriPara changes dreams into miracles!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.200
After today,

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.630
we can switch these.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.330
Falulu will go and say hello to Lala!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.540
Let's go and say hello to Falulu and the gang!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.840
Wait-pri!

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.660
Falulu, Fuwari!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.530
Let's go back.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:48.770
But...

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.180
We'll lose our focus-pri!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.690
This isn't a game.

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:03.750
Did my supplements help?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.870
I didn't use them.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:11.140
What a shame, you have the same level of potential as Falulu.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.810
I'm expecting a high level of competition.

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.240
Pshu.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.470
We definitely won't lose!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:27.940
Jululu...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.660
One!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.100
Two!

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.250
Sophie!
One!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:34.770
One!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:34.900
Let's give it our all until it's time!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.580
Two!

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.970
One!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:38.850
Capisce!

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.020
The Divine Idol Gran Prix Final Tournament!

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.280
Today, we have the semi-finals.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:56.790
This event is being live watched from 500 million places around the globe!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.880
It has been a terrific competition so far,

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.500
but the semi-finals are finally here.

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:15.110
I hope I can hear more miraculous singing voices.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.300
Here's how we'll decide the order!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.780
Leave drawing first to me!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.370
Yeah, first!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.790
All that training paid off!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.970
Solami Smile, upon seeing our performance first will

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.580
surely lose hope.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.510
Scan the number of MyTickets required for your coord.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.250
You can scan your Friend Tickets too.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.050
Coord change start!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.190
Let the games begin with this magician-inspired coord!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.940
Flower PriParis Coord!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.250
Only one step to victory!

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:09.650
Tricolore are the best!

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.540
Huh? They're not coming out...

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.270
Where'd they go?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.700
Making Drama, switch on!

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:03.110
Falulu is so pretty, Tricolore are the best!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.150
Continuous making dramas?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:25.780
What on earth!?

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.550
It's like a kaleidoscope-nano!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.360
Another one!?

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:00.740
Super Cyalume Change!

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.390
Hibiki-sama, you're my star!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.660
Falulu-sama is like a fairy!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.180
Fuwari you're amazing!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.850
An applause of that scale has <i>never</i> been heard before!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.910
There was absolutely no faults!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:50.540
They've already won!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.640
You can't match that!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.640
Tricolore are the strongest!

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.340
Tricolore at the best!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:01.400
Tricolore Divine Idols confirmed!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.750
The best in PriPara!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.010
I can't imagine anything better than that!

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:08.370
The applause is showing no signs of stopping.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:09.930
Sophie!

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:18.050
TL Note: Tongue twisters

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.340
Gross...
TL Note: Tongue twisters

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:26.870
Hey, Mirei.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.950
Do you remember our first performance?

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:35.460
Obviously, as if I'd forget-pri.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.070
Everyone's waiting for idols to sing-pri!

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:42.160
So let's sing so everyone can hear us-pri!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:47.960
I've come so far because of those words.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:50.940
I've only made it this far,

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.820
because you came,

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.040
back then-pri.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:00.000
I've also come this far,

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.290
"I like you whichever way you are, Sophie".

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.100
because you said that.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:12.840
And because Lala and Mirei made a team with me.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.730
That's why I'm here.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:22.950
I'm so happy we can all perform together-pri!

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:27.400
Whatever the result, I have no regrets-pri.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:30.580
We won't lose for sure!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.790
We'll definitely win!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.420
Yeah!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.490
Let's win!

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.990
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.650
Let's knock them out the park!

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:40.050
Out the park!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.250
I'm changing the song-pri!

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.750
Scan the number of MyTickets required for your coord.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.310
You can scan your Friend Tickets too.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.310
Stage gate in!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.120
It's Mirei!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.960
I'm Solami Smile's Mirei-pri!

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.630
Do you like PriPara, everyone-pri!?

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.880
We love it!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.500
Then there's no problems-pri!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:28.030
I'm so pop step happy to have met you all-pri!

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.790
My little caged birds,

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.600
listen to me if you've been good.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.610
So cool!

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.100
I can't hear you!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.530
Sorry!

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:52.960
I guess there's no choice, I can't remain silent.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.370
I'll show you the best performance ever.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.360
I can't promise you won't die from the excitement...

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.000
So everyone can hear...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.250
So everyone around the world can hear...

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.490
In your loudest voice!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.580
Here we go!

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.180
Altogether now-pri!

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.460
We're all friends!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.820
We're all idols!

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.020
Look up and smile!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.570
Solami Smile!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.760
This song takes me back-kuma!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.080
The foundation of Solami Smile-kuma!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.940
You all know this song, right!?

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.780
Sing with us-pri!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:37.020
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:30.410
For her to be able to do continuous making dramas,

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:33.340
Sophie really has gotten stronger-kuma!

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:36.350
I know Sophie's strength more than anyone-usa!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.760
Woah, another special making drama!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:43.920
So much fun!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.760
Super Cyalume Change!

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:12.600
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.690
Solami!
Tricolore!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.030
Solami!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.870
Tricolore!

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.340
How unpredictable!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.580
Now, to the results!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.760
Who won-nano!?

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.550
Who won!?

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:57.700
Who won-chanko!?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:58.710
Who won!?

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:06.100
I-It's close. It's so close!

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:07.930
Laser judgment!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:12.230
And the winner is...

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:14.600
Solami Smile!!

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:23.800
No way...

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.620
They did it-usa!
They did it-kuma!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.000
Is this... a dream-pri?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.550
Ow!

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.860
Ouch, that means, it isn't a dream!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.430
It's not a dream!

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:05.150
Congratulations!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:06.740
Hibiki-san!

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.100
I had fun.

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.790
Me too-pri.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.550
You really gave it your all.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.410
Not unlike yourself.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.160
"We're all friends, we're all idols".

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.960
A worthy theme for the opening of the

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.260
Parajuku Divine Idol Gran Prix.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.110
Thank you so much!

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.890
I guess populism won this time.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.640
Popu... what?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.100
Your stage was amazing too-pri!

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:41.110
Thanks.

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:45.110
Falulu, I wanted to see you!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:46.290
Me too.

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:48.500
Congratulations, Lala.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:51.110
Even though we lost, I had so much fun!

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:53.260
Let's do it again in PriParis!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.290
The final is...

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.200
Solami Smile vs Dressing Pafe!

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.500
Yes! I finally won!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:14.660
Really!?

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:17.460
Well done Shion!

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:18.600
Congratulations!
